:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Li'l King Dragon Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Li'l Lizard Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Lucky Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] grants increased health, attack power, range and recharge time. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]].

